{
 "_about": "Pause + settings menu (lane laneMENU, v100). Read by MenuCfg.cs. Esc / pad Start opens PAUSE (time stopped). enabled=false removes the menu. harnessArgs = command-line flags of the proof / capture runs: the menu stays off and the saved settings.json is ignored there. Colours come from hud.json colors{}. Tabs: type 'list' rows are gs (a GameSettings.MenuRows id, laneTIERS), resolution, fullscreen, vsync, framecap, mix (one slider per audio_mix.json category with menu=true), slider (key camSens|deadZone or an audio_mix.json category id), toggle (key hints), reset (key audio|gameplay|display); type 'controls' = the read-only key map built from controls.rows + controls.json. Saved to Application.persistentDataPath/settings.json (defaults below fill whatever is missing). The graphics tier and the free camera option are saved by GameSettings (PlayerPrefs), not here.",
 "enabled": true,
 "allowOnEndScreen": true,
 "maxFadeToOpen": 0.5,
 "unfreezeMaxS": 0.5,
 "saveDelayS": 0.6,
 "openWaitS": 0.8,
 "harnessArgs": [
  "-balanceauto",
  "-autoplay",
  "-finisherauto",
  "-finisherrotonly",
  "-postureproof",
  "-camproof",
  "-flowproof",
  "-verifyGround",
  "-looptest",
  "-latencyprobe",
  "-perfbench",
  "-steerauto",
  "-steerpreview",
  "-gaps",
  "-props",
  "-record",
  "-sheet:",
  "-headsheet",
  "-cmp",
  "-stand",
  "-isolate",
  "-facecam"
 ],
 "input": {
  "_about": "KeyCode names. openKeys opens; backKeys = one level back (on the pause list = resume); closeKeys = resume from any screen (pad Start). Navigation: arrows / WASD / left stick (Input Manager axes axisX / axisY, empty = off), A = confirm, B = back, Q / E or LB / RB = tabs. Mouse: hover, click, wheel.",
